A witness for rule J12's first clause: a register row citing an assurance figure the
generated report does not define.

This is the shape a row takes after the report's table is renamed or a metric is dropped.
The citation still reads like a figure and resolves to nothing, which is the state a typed
number reaches silently and a citation must not.

    Every unit assessed Security=High carries a criterion, and {criteria:unitsthatwerenevercounted}
    of them were written this milestone.
